    "title": "Opening for Production Engineer at ACC Limited Advisory Limited",
    "description": "Grow your career with ACC Limited Advisory Limited! We are hiring a Production Engineer for our Gwalior team. Be part of a workplace that celebrates innovation, diversity, and performance.\n\nAbout ACC Limited Advisory Limited:\nACC Limited Advisory Limited is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Oversee daily production operations to meet output targets\n• Ensure product quality meets internal and customer specifications\n• Conduct root cause analysis for quality rejections and defects\n• Train and supervise shop floor workers and supervisors\n• Ensure environmental compliance and waste management\n• Prepare production cost analysis and efficiency reports\n• Monitor equipment performance and coordinate preventive maintenance\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Diploma or Degree in Hospitality Management\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Kaizen\n• Proficiency in Root Cause Analysis\n• Proficiency in ISO 9001\n• Proficiency in AutoCAD\n• Proficiency in ERP Systems\n• Proficiency in SolidWorks\n• Proficiency in GD&T\n• Proficiency in PLC/SCADA\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Gwalior, Madhya Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with ACC Limited Advisory Limited!",
